The design-md skill describes a file format specified by Google:

  Repository : google-labs-code/design.md
  Path       : docs/spec.md (format version "alpha")
  URL        : https://github.com/google-labs-code/design.md
  License    : Apache License 2.0
  Copyright  : 2026 Google LLC

skills/design-md/references/format.md is this project's own condensed description
of that format, written for the skill. No passage or table of the specification is
copied into it; it links to the specification as the authority. Section names, key
names and property names are reproduced because a file in the format must use them.
No DESIGN.md file from VoltAgent/awesome-design-md is bundled.

