Short passages from Microsoft documentation. Several reference files paraphrase
Microsoft Learn and Microsoft Support pages and link to them as the source. One
sentence is quoted, in docs/create-app.md (and paraphrased in
skills/create-app/references/harvesting.md): that only properties that differ from
their default values are serialized (Power Apps YAML documentation,
https://learn.microsoft.com/power-apps/maker/canvas-apps/power-apps-yaml).
Microsoft documentation is (c) Microsoft Corporation.

